  "preparation_and_cleanup_corrections": [
    "A compile-only trial used a relocated Mix dependency directory, but the relation manifest reads the checkout's hosted/deps/oban. The completed runner uses that standard directory in a disposable archive.",
    "First fixture startup published the signed release and authenticated, then stopped before the checkout schedule. Its expected URL used a literal ampersand, while Go encodes it as a JSON Unicode escape. Its port rebind probe was corrected to use separate sockets for connection and bind. The owned process groups were reaped, both service ports rebound, and fixture and socket data were removed.",
    "The passing run used the corrected fixture and one checkout schedule. Its owned Go module directories were made writable for removal. The delivered runner adds the cleanup-only Go flag -modcacherw, separately verified with a fresh locked pgx download and ordinary cache deletion. The ExUnit fixture and service sources are unchanged from the passing run."
